atement":"The input has m columns. Column i contains: X_i in {0,1}^m; strings A_{i,1},...,A_{i,r} in {0,1}^{km} with no promise; and for each s in {0,1}^r a cell B_{i,s} holding, for each j != i, a pointer p_{i,s,j} in [m] encoded in l bits by a fixed bijection, and for each h in [r] an alleged evaluation transcript of C_{k,m} on A_{i,h}.","statement_sha256":"d9218ca3945f4873563558e42c95034d55721401eac270bbe30149248b1188f3"}
